---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Best VPNs for Traveling in China";
const description = "The best VPNs for China — what works, what doesn't, and how to set up your VPN before you arrive.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Life
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🔒 中国生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Best VPNs for Traveling in China
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">在你走之前把它设置好，否则你就无法上网了。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读5分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>离家前设置VPN。</strong> Once you're inside China, VPN websites and Google Play are blocked — you won't be able to download or subscribe from there.
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#why" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">❓ 为什么在中国需要VPN</a></li>
        <li><a href="#best" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏆 中国最佳VPN</a></li>
        <li><a href="#setup" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">⚙️ 如何在出发前设置VPN</a></li>
        <li><a href="#troubleshoot" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🔧 故障排除：VPN不工作？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#free-vs-paid" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💰 免费VPN与付费VPN</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="why" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❓</span> Why You Need a VPN in China
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">中国的互联网防火墙屏蔽了一长串西方网站和服务，包括：</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">📱 社交媒体</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Instagram、Facebook、Twitter/X、TikTok（国际版）</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">💬 消息传递</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">WhatsApp、Telegram（部分屏蔽）、Signal</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">🔍 搜索和地图</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">谷歌（所有服务），包括Gmail</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">🎵 视频和音乐</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">YouTube、网飞、Spotify</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 md:col-span-2">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">📰 新闻</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">英国广播公司、美国有线电视新闻网、《纽约时报》</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">如果您在工作、通信或娱乐中依赖其中任何一项，VPN是必不可少的。</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="best" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏆</span> Best VPNs for China
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3">🚀 ExpressVPN</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>中国最可靠的选择之一（使用模糊技术）</li>
          <li>流媒体和视频通话速度快</li>
          <li>30天退款保证</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- AFFILIATE: ExpressVPN 联盟链接 -->
      </div>

      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">🛡️ NordVPN</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>为受限网络设计的具有模糊服务器的大型服务器网络</li>
          <li>强大的安全功能（终止开关、双VPN）</li>
          <li>如果服务器被阻止，偶尔需要切换服务器</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- AFFILIATE: NordVPN 联盟链接 -->
      </div>

      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-3">🐉 冲鲨</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>预算友好，设备连接不受限制</li>
          <li>在中国以无国界模式工作</li>
          <li>长途旅行或团体/家庭旅行的好选择</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- AFFILIATE: Surfshark 联盟链接 -->
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>专业提示：</strong> Download and install at least <strong>旅行前使用VPN。如果其中一个被阻止或出现问题，您将准备好备份。</strong> VPNs before your trip. If one gets blocked or has issues, you'll have a backup ready to go.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="setup" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">⚙️</span> How to Set Up Your VPN Before You Go
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <div><strong>从上面的列表</strong> from the list above</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <div><strong>您所有设备（手机、笔记本电脑、平板电脑）上的应用程序</strong> the app on all your devices (phone, laptop, tablet)</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <div><strong>还在家的时候</strong> while still at home</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <div><strong>--连接到中国境外的服务器并确保其正常工作</strong> — connect to a server outside China and make sure it works</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">5</span>
            <div><strong>（如果VPN下降，将切断互联网——这在中国很重要）</strong> (cuts internet if VPN drops — important in China)</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-500 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">6</span>
            <div><strong>如果你需要重新下载应用程序</strong> in case you need to re-download the app</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="troubleshoot" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔧</span> Troubleshooting: VPN Not Working?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">🔄 切换服务器</p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">随着时间的推移，一些IP会被屏蔽。尝试其他服务器位置。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">🔧 尝试其他协议</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">OpenVPN或WireGuard可能比默认协议效果更好。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">📞 联系支持</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">ExpressVPN和NordVPN提供全天候实时聊天，可以建议可用的服务器。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">📱 使用您的备份VPN</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">这就是为什么我们建议有两个。</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">这就是我们建议准备两个的原因。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="free-vs-paid" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💰</span> Free VPNs vs Paid VPNs
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>原因如下：</strong> Here's why:</p>

      <ul class="space-y-4 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🚫</span>
          <div>
            <strong>他们没有配置绕过中国防火墙的服务器。</strong> They don't have servers configured to bypass China's firewall.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🐌</span>
          <div>
            <strong>免费服务对于视频通话或流媒体来说通常太慢了。</strong> Free services are often too slow for video calls or streaming.
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-red-500 text-xl">🔓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>众所周知，一些免费VPN会记录和出售用户数据，这在中国是有风险的。</strong> Some free VPNs have been known to log and sell user data — risky in China.
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">📚 相关指南</p>

      <!-- AFFILIATE: VPN 提供商联盟计划汇总 — ExpressVPN, NordVPN, Surfshark -->
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 您的中国之旅生存工具包</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">📶 游客最佳SIM卡和eSIM</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/sim-card-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📶 游客最佳SIM卡和eSIM</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">🛡️ 去中国旅行安全吗？</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/tips/is-china-safe/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🛡️ 去中国旅行安全吗？</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">来源</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>VPN服务经常变化。没有单一官方来源。出行前请查询当前推荐。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>